{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026wrm3LOOwel1785731578.jpeg\"/><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">楊明與莊思明日前（2 日）於馬來西亞吉隆坡舉行盛大婚禮，人緣極佳的二人吸引大批圈中好友特意飛往當地祝賀，出席賓客陣容龐大，包括：薛家燕、馬國明、湯洛雯、黎諾懿、關禮傑、楊卓娜、張慧儀、譚嘉儀、關嘉敏、陳少邦、趙永洪、陳智燊、宋熙年、丘梓謙、何晉樂、吳沚默、陳懿德、傅明憲及馬蹄露等，場面熱鬧溫馨。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"7de04f54-96a5-44fe-9f31-889d3c05.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/20261eI7M1UNgF1785730685.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"7de04f54-96a5-44fe-9f31-889d3c05.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\">其中，馬國明與妻子湯洛雯攜手現身，成為現場眾多賓客的集郵對象；而黎諾懿、楊卓娜等多位初代《愛·回家》演員難得同場重聚，亦勾起不少網民的回憶。</p><p class=\"p1\" style=\"text-align: left;\"> </p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"c5fd42a1-0d24-48a5-bdee-448926d1.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026GfZjgVmNcZ1785730686.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"c5fd42a1-0d24-48a5-bdee-448926d1.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-03 下午12.17.17.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026T2jczloV3W1785730686.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"螢幕截圖 2026-08-03 下午12.17.17.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p class=\"p2\" style=\"text-align: left;\">提到婚禮的重頭戲「拋花球」，莊思明事前接受訪問時曾透露現場不少好友仍單身，並特別點名吳沚默、劉晨芝及關嘉敏等人：「好多人都好想拍拖，特別想關嘉敏，因之前女神配對未能成功，希望佢有機會接到花球，分享好運！」到了拋花球環節，現場一眾單身姊妹熱情投入，氣氛推至高潮。最終花球由馬蹄露幸運接到，為婚禮增添驚喜亮點，現場賓客亦紛紛送上祝福，希望將好運與幸福延續給身邊好友。</p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"71fe50f0-1a67-4f3f-9ac9-0a819ff1.png\" src=\"https://tvb-vod-hk.oss-cn-hongkong.aliyuncs.com/uploads/image/2026/08/2026qmwEWsCsI61785730685.png\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"71fe50f0-1a67-4f3f-9ac9-0a819ff1.png\"/>\n</div>\n</div></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-03T04:38:23.705793+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":401,"images":5,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}